1135 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Core competencies\nConsumer Product Design at Scale\072  Multi\055surface design \050mobile\054 console\054 web\051\054 multi\055persona IA\054 habit formation mechanics\054 community and social systems\054 personalization and recommendation surfaces\015\nIC Design Leadership\072  0\2221 product definition\054 platform\055scale systems thinking\054 design strategy\054 executive storytelling\054 cross\055functional influence without authority\015\nData\055Informed Design\072  Behavioral signal integration\054 experimentation\055driven iteration\054 A\057B testing frameworks\054 analytics\055informed design decisions\015\nDesign Leadership \046 Team Development\072  Track record of growing and mentoring design talent\054 leading cross\055functional teams\054 building design culture\056 Available as a high\055impact IC\054 player\055coach\054 or people manager as needed\015\nCraft \046 Tooling\072  Figma\054 FigJam\054 design systems\054 high\055fidelity prototyping\054 motion design principles\054 AI tools \050Cursor\054 Perplexity\054 Claude\054 etc\046\051\015\nResearch Methods\072  Generative research\054 usability testing\054 competitive analysis\054 UX audit\054 stakeholder interviews\015)
