1143 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Experience\nDesign Architect  \042 \240Microsoft \024 Xbox\nMar 2020 \023 Jan 2026\nSenior\055most IC design role at Xbox\054 reporting directly to the Head of Design\056 Defined product strategy\054 shaped executive roadmaps\054 and owned end\055to\055end design across platform\055level consumer experiences for a global audience of 20M\053 monthly active users\056 Led the Community design team to deliver core engagement and safety functionality to customers\056\nOwned end\055to\055end design of Xbox Benefits Hub \050a multi\055surface engagement and rewards experience across console\054 mobile\054 and PC\051 driving \0531\0566M gameplay hours \050\05334\045 weekly average\051 and \053\044292K in monthly active spend \050\05332\045 weekly average\051 within three weeks of launch\056\nDesigned for multiple distinct user personas simultaneously\072 casual players\054 highly engaged subscribers\054 and new platform entrants\056 Each with different motivations\054 entry points\054 and activation paths\056\nEvolved the experience across two phases\072 a tactical\054 constraint\055led first investment that proved the hypothesis\054 followed by a full cross\055device platform initiative spanning mobile\054 PC\054 and console\056\nLed architecture and design for the consolidation of Xbox\047s two mobile apps into a unified product serving 20M\053 MAU\056 Defined information architecture\054 navigation system\054 and migration experience\056\nGenerated \0444M\053 in revenue within the first 30 days of enabling in\055app purchases \050125\045 above the \0441\0569M initial forecast\051\056\nDesigned for a split audience of console\055first gamers and subscription\055first Game Pass members\054 requiring a single IA that served divergent mental models without alienating either group\056\nDesigned personalization and recommendation surfaces across the Xbox platform\054 translating behavioral data signals \050play history\054 content affinity\054 social graph activity\051 into ambient\054 non\055intrusive discovery experiences at consumer scale\056\nDelivered family safety and parental control experiences\054 navigating multi\055generational use cases and divergent permission models across a shared household product\056\nContributed to the Xbox Design System \050XDS\051 governance\054 establishing component patterns and interaction standards adopted across multiple product teams and surfaces\056\nDesigned community\054 social\054 and onboarding features \050including friends systems\054 party mechanics\054 game invites\054 and achievements\051 driving habit formation and retention across Xbox\047s platform\056\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1144 0 R
     /Pg 1132 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

